Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.30,0:03:15.43,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,伴你身侧　佯装只是场巧合
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.43,0:03:19.22,OP - JP,,10,0,15,,{\c&H000000&\blur5}それくらいが　丁度良く　濁ってく
Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.43,0:03:19.22,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,それくらいが　丁度良く　濁ってく
Dialogue: 3,0:03:15.43,0:03:19.22,OP - CN,,10,0,60,,{\c&H000000&\blur5}若即若离　气氛暧昧得刚好
Dialogue: 4,0:03:15.43,0:03:19.22,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,若即若离　气氛暧昧得刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.48,0:22:12.81,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur4\fax-0.12}見つけたい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.48,0:22:12.81,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur4\fax-0.12}四处寻觅着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.81,0:22:16.15,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}まだ知らない　君を探してる
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.81,0:22:16.15,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}那个陌生的你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.69,0:22:19.28,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}話したい　ことばかりで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.69,0:22:19.28,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}怀揣满腔情思
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:21.91,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}時間が過ぎてゆく
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.28,0:22:21.91,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}时光缓缓流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.91,0:22:23.91,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}明日も　ここで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.91,0:22:23.91,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}愿明天在此地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.91,0:22:26.74,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}同じ場所で会えるように
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.91,0:22:26.74,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}再度与你相会
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:28.54,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}Goodbye
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.12,0:22:28.54,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.38,0:22:40.34,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}XXL サイズ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.38,0:22:40.34,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}XXL 尺寸的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.34,0:22:43.55,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}胸の内を今も
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.34,0:22:43.55,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}我如今的内心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.55,0:22:45.51,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}見えない様にと
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.55,0:22:45.51,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}依旧不愿被人窥探
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.51,0:22:48.77,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}覆い隠した
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.51,0:22:48.77,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}于是层层掩藏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.77,0:22:50.77,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}なんでも良いけれど
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.77,0:22:50.77,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}即便说着不在意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.77,0:22:53.60,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}一枚隔てたら
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.77,0:22:53.60,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}但若是咫尺相隔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.60,0:22:57.94,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}本音がきけるから
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.60,0:22:57.94,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}就能听到我的心曲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.94,0:23:00.61,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}フィクション／ノンフィクション
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.94,0:23:00.61,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}虚构与真实
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.61,0:23:03.15,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}事実も中にはあるかもしれない？
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.61,0:23:03.15,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}或许谎言中夹杂着几分真心？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.15,0:23:05.78,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}フィクション／ノンフィクション
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.15,0:23:05.78,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}虚构与真实
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.78,0:23:08.37,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}嘘もほんとも全部
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.78,0:23:08.37,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}真亦假时假亦真
