Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.74,0:23:13.58,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}那个陌生的你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.58,0:23:16.13,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}話したい　ことばかりで
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.58,0:23:16.13,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}怀揣满腔情思
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.13,0:23:18.75,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}時間が過ぎてゆく
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.13,0:23:18.75,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}时光缓缓流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.75,0:23:21.30,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}横たわる　この世界も
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.75,0:23:21.30,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}眼前的这片天地
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.30,0:23:23.88,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}気づけば　暮れている
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.30,0:23:23.88,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}回过神时已是夕阳残照
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:25.89,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4\fax-0.12}明日も　ここで
